---
import Review from './Review.astro';
import SectionHead from './SectionHead.astro';
const inherited = ['What we’re capable of.', 'What we’re supposed to become.', 'What is realistic.', 'What is reasonable.', 'What is out of reach.'];
---
<section id="idea" class="bg-paper py-24 md:py-36" aria-labelledby="idea-title">
  <div class="wrap grid grid-cols-4 gap-x-5 md:grid-cols-12 md:gap-x-6">
    <SectionHead index="01" label="Transformation" />

    <h2 id="idea-title" class="display col-span-4 text-[13vw] uppercase md:col-span-10 md:text-[7.4vw] 2xl:text-[7.25rem]">
      <span class="reveal block">Normal is a definition.</span>
      <span class="reveal block text-[#8a8a8a]" style="--d:100ms">Not a destination.</span>
    </h2>

    <div class="col-span-4 mt-16 md:col-span-4 md:mt-28">
      <div class="reveal md:sticky md:top-32">
        <p class="label text-ash">nor·mal <span class="normal-case tracking-normal">/ˈnɔːr.məl/</span> · adjective</p>
        <p class="lede mt-4 text-2xl md:text-[1.75rem]">We all inherit definitions of what’s normal.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <ul class="col-span-4 mt-10 md:col-span-7 md:col-start-6 md:mt-28" aria-label="Inherited definitions">
      {inherited.map((line) => (
        <li class="border-t border-line-ink py-5 last:border-b md:py-6">
          <span class="strike lede text-[8.4vw] md:text-[3.4vw] 2xl:text-[3.3rem]" data-strike="scroll" style="--strike-weight:0.045em">{line}</span>
        </li>
      ))}
    </ul>

    <div class="col-span-4 mt-20 grid gap-10 md:col-span-12 md:mt-32 md:grid-cols-12 md:gap-6">
      <p class="reveal lede text-[2.1rem] md:col-span-6 md:text-[clamp(2.4rem,3.6vw,3.6rem)]">
        Over time, those assumptions become our definition of normal. But normal isn’t necessarily permanent.
      </p>
      <div class="reveal space-y-5 text-lg leading-relaxed text-ash md:col-span-5 md:col-start-8 md:self-end" style="--d:120ms">
        <p>Cameron’s journey — from being 60 pounds overweight to representing Team USA and becoming a national triathlon champion — demonstrates how dramatically our lives can change when we begin challenging those assumptions and committing to a different path.</p>
        <p class="text-ink">Redefine Normal is about that transformation. Not simply imagining what’s possible, but understanding how to begin making it possible.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
